+## On-device translation
+
+The language picker in the header translates article bodies, headlines and teasers right in the browser using Chrome's built-in [Translator API](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/ai/translator-api) (and the Language Detector API to work out the source language). Nothing is sent to a server; language models are downloaded on first use. Mark any element with `data-translatable` to include its text. The picker is disabled in browsers that don't support the API.
